Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=32}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.99,0:02:22.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] This weather's perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.12,0:02:25.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY grunts, chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.42,0:02:27.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] So which way is the Grand Line?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.23,0:02:29.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[sighs] Is it that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.25,0:02:30.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.07,0:02:33.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Or maybe... this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.04,0:02:35.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That way. Over here.\NMaybe there? I dunno.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.39,0:02:38.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where could it be? I wanna\Nsee this place! I wanna see!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.35,0:02:39.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You need to sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.05,0:02:41.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Geez... you bug me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.59,0:02:46.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry. Heh! I'm just excited\Nthat we finally got a cook on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.96,0:02:48.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now we just need Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.90,0:02:51.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then nothing will stand between\Nus and the Grand Line!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.97,0:02:58.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Nami, ah... I could just sit around all day\Nand think about how beautiful she is...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.04,0:03:00.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't wait till I\Nget to see her again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.40,0:03:05.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So. Are we getting close\Nto where Nami is?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.37,0:03:07.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know, the island?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.57,0:03:10.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're way too naïve and way too young!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.44,0:03:11.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't you get it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.61,0:03:16.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2\fad(0,936)}Don't you realize every second that passes\Nbrings us closer to the infamous Arlong?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.76,0:03:22.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU] Nami couldn't stop\Nlooking at Arlong's picture
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.17,0:03:24.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,when she saw it. And it\Nwasn't a normal kinda stare.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.81,0:03:28.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There was something different\Nabout the way she was staring.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.81,0:03:30.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Something focused.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.36,0:03:34.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[birds chirping]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.12,0:03:36.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU] I'm telling you, Nami's\Nplanning on taking down Arlong
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.99,0:03:39.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and then collecting the\Ntwenty million-berry bounty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.39,0:03:41.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,For all we know,\Nwhile we just sit here,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.37,0:03:43.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,she's already making her\Nway through his compound!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.95,0:03:45.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY yawns]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.84,0:03:46.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's nice. Let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.04,0:03:47.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.75,0:03:49.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[shouts]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.46,0:03:51.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you guys are so clueless
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.16,0:03:53.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that you have actually never\Nheard of the evil Arlong?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.87,0:03:55.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh, no. So who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.91,0:03:56.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.76,0:03:59.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.97,0:04:01.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[whistling]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.36,0:04:06.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Listen up, boys! Time for your education\Non the cunning shark that is Arlong!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.76,0:04:09.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Arlong is a fishman who used to\Ndestroy everything in his path
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.06,0:04:11.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,up and down the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.33,0:04:11.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fishman?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.86,0:04:14.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's cool. I don't think I've\Never met one of those before.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.20,0:04:18.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've heard that the females on\NFishman Island are some of the most
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.77,0:04:21.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,beautiful creatures in\Nthe world to behold.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.04,0:04:22.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fishman sounds weird...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.90,0:04:24.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do they look like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.12,0:04:25.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.95,0:04:28.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU screams] Can't you focus\Nfor just one minute, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.80,0:04:32.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Alright... I will start\Nfrom the very beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.41,0:04:35.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The reason they call the Grand Line\Na pirate graveyard in the first place
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.58,0:04:39.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,is because of Arlong and the other\Ntwo powers like him who rule over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.68,0:04:43.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The first of the powers are known\Nas the Seven Warlords of the Sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.61,0:04:48.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seven Warlords?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.48,0:04:51.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Seven Warlords are pirates\Nauthorized by the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.90,0:04:53.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seriously...?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.10,0:04:57.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,980)}Why would any pirate on the sea\Nwant government approval?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.46,0:04:58.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU] For protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.76,0:05:02.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The government looks the other way\Nin exchange for a cut of their treasure,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.23,0:05:04.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and they're allowed to exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.13,0:05:06.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,'Course to other pirates\Nthey're just government dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.71,0:05:09.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But they didn't get to where\Nthey are by being weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.28,0:05:12.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,These guys are powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.04,0:05:17.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[pirates shouting]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.21,0:05:20.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU] The man who defeated\NZoro is one of these Warlords.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.55,0:05:22.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,His name is Hawkeye Mihawk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.91,0:05:24.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.51,0:05:26.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to meet all\Nseven of these guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.78,0:05:28.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They sound awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.91,0:05:32.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Yeah... Well, the first among the Warlords,\Nat least first you should know about,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.62,0:05:34.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,is Jinbei, captain of the fishmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.12,0:05:38.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He is dangerous like\Nno one you've ever known...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.12,0:05:42.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Easily causing as much havoc and\Ndestruction around the Grand Line as Arlong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.74,0:05:45.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is this closer?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.94,0:05:48.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That looks just like your last\Npicture only standing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.98,0:05:53.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Arlong has taken control of over twenty\Ntowns since coming to the East Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.53,0:05:55.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,His strength easily\Nsurpasses anyone you've
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.63,0:05:57.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,encountered including\Nthat of Don Krieg's...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.77,0:05:59.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's devastating.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.46,0:06:03.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So why do you think Nami would go\Nafter this guy, all by herself, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.96,0:06:07.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I told you already, she wants\Nto collect the bounty on his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.55,0:06:10.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, wouldn't it be great\Nif Nami was a mermaid?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.58,0:06:14.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'd give anything to see that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.70,0:06:15.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She'd look like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.94,0:06:18.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tear that thing up... or die!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.44,0:06:21.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[YOSAKU] Have either of you morons heard\Na single word that I've said to you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.94,0:06:23.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Sure. Badass fishmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.08,0:06:25.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Some guy's stronger than some\Nother guy. We get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.08,0:06:27.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU sighs]\NNo, you don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.83,0:06:30.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You've never had to face a fishman.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.38,0:06:34.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, uh... we will when we get\Nthere so don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.68,0:06:37.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI grunts] I guess\NI'll get lunch started.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.66,0:06:39.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,'Bout time! Let's eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.76,0:06:40.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What? Food?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.98,0:06:42.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What're you in the mood for?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.71,0:06:44.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I want meat right off the bone!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.77,0:06:46.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I want sautéed bean sprouts!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.72,0:06:48.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] Okay, leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.32,0:06:51.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This won't take long.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.78,0:06:53.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Meat and bean sprouts, no prob.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.61,0:06:57.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Man, having a cook is\Nthe best! Huh? Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.45,0:06:58.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.65,0:07:00.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Bring me meat! Lots of meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.85,0:07:03.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU] Sprouts! I want\Nbean sprouts! Bean sprouts!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.59,0:07:20.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] Here's this month's\Ntake. I hope you enjoy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.93,0:07:24.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[cheeps] Ah, Arlong.\NYou are so much smarter
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.10,0:07:26.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,than your regular\Nrun-of-the-mill pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.17,0:07:28.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know how the world works.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.76,0:07:31.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.85,0:07:35.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Likewise. There aren't many Marine\Ncaptains who know that befriending me means
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.74,0:07:37.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,they can milk the\NEast Blue for eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.41,0:07:42.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}The fact that you understand makes you more\Nlike me, than any other Marine out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.92,0:07:44.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.32,0:07:46.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.48,0:07:47.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't thank me, thank money!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.42,0:07:50.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's the only thing you can\Ncount on in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.41,0:07:55.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's more reliable than people,\Nthat's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.13,0:07:56.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.71,0:07:58.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NEZUMI gasps]\NOf course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.93,0:08:00.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,As a rule I hate all humans,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.05,0:08:03.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but you are the one tolerable\Nexception that I've found.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.05,0:08:06.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well... if you'll excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.62,0:08:09.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why not stay awhile and\Nhave a drink with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.72,0:08:14.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I would, but the longer a Marine\Ncruiser stays docked at a pirate island,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.15,0:08:15.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the quicker we get unwanted attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.22,0:08:17.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[ARLONG] I'll kill anyone who reports you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.12,0:08:19.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everybody knows that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.69,0:08:22.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NEZUMI] Thank you,\Nbut still, we must go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.00,0:08:24.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] Hey, the captain is leaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.40,0:08:26.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Escort him back to his ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.97,0:08:27.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[HATCHAN] Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.54,0:08:31.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The pot's back that way... Hop in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.01,0:08:34.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank you! That's very kind of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.58,0:08:37.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[HATCHAN] When I see your face, it always\Nmakes me want to laugh. It's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.17,0:08:39.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You look like a rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.08,0:08:41.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.67,0:08:43.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hatchan, watch your mouth now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.04,0:08:45.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The captain's our honored guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.92,0:08:48.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[HATCHAN] Oh, right, sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.30,0:08:50.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NEZUMI] Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.57,0:08:55.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[HATCHAN] Here we go, men.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.54,0:09:00.24,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[NEZUMI] These fishmen are\Ndisgusting. Such a vile group.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.24,0:09:02.44,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,But they sure do pay well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.67,0:09:19.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHABO] Hey, you. Get outta my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.94,0:09:22.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Arlong's going to die today!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.91,0:09:26.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He killed my daddy and so now\NI'm gonna have to kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.11,0:09:31.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So move, or I'll have to kill you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.75,0:09:32.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.43,0:09:35.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHABO grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.12,0:09:37.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.36,0:09:39.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You should know that Arlong\Ndoesn't have time to deal with
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.43,0:09:41.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,whimpering little punks like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.65,0:09:44.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're too young. Go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.61,0:09:46.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHABO whimpers]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.51,0:09:49.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Take that with you and use it\Nto keep yourself out of trouble, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.99,0:09:52.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.80,0:10:01.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] Nami! You've returned!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.50,0:10:04.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen you around\Nhere for quite a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.22,0:10:06.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, how did you do this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.27,0:10:08.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Heh. Who are you talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.24,0:10:12.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know, I can't believe the world is\Nfull of such blind idiots... Wanna see?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.38,0:10:14.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.21,0:10:17.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You, girl, are one excellent liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.05,0:10:18.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.72,0:10:21.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] Listen up, everybody!\NNami's finally returned!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.95,0:10:23.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Time for a party!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.23,0:10:28.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FISHMEN cheer]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.72,0:10:52.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Alright. We're here.\NThat's Arlong Park ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.66,0:10:57.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Arlong Park, huh?\NSo this is the hideout of
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.13,0:10:59.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Arlong the Fishman Pirate\Nfrom the Grand Line?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.85,0:11:01.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gulps]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.52,0:11:04.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] I hope Nami's really here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.84,0:11:07.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Big Sis Nami's ship\Nwas the {\i1}Going Merry{\i0},
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.51,0:11:10.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so before we do anything stupid,\Nwe should quietly check
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.27,0:11:12.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to see if it stopped\Non this island first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.34,0:11:13.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.06,0:11:20.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.92,0:11:25.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But I just said we shouldn't\Ndo anything stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.22,0:11:26.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?! Attack?! You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.06,0:11:29.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We know nothing about this place!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.09,0:11:31.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, these guys are the fishmen!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.42,0:11:33.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We need some kinda plan to do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.39,0:11:36.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] While the two of you are\Nbusy blabbering and wimping out,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.32,0:11:39.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm placing my thoughts on the\Nbattle we're about to face.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.26,0:11:42.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy told me to bring her\Nback and I'll do just that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.39,0:11:43.93,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP, JOHNNY whimper]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.02,0:11:44.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.48,0:11:48.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP, JOHNNY grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.78,0:11:53.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP gasps]\NThere it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.75,0:11:56.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha! Found it! The {\i1}Going Merry{\i0}.\NIt's right over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.92,0:11:58.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then she has to be on\Nthe island somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.79,0:12:00.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We just have to find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.46,0:12:02.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?!\NWould you idiots untie me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.96,0:12:04.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I am not the enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.36,0:12:09.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY] We're east of Arlong\NPark, here at Cocoyashi Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.01,0:12:10.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But it's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.61,0:12:13.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why would she have stopped\Nso far from the village?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.87,0:12:15.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Untie me, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.91,0:12:17.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Zoro, you're hurt way too bad
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.65,0:12:21.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to be of any help when we go ashore.\NJust sit tight and relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.47,0:12:23.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.47,0:12:26.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's okay. Rest up.\NYou can help next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.40,0:12:31.57,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] One of these days I'm gonna\Nskewer him like a piece of meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.57,0:12:34.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fear not, gentlemen. I will\Nbring the girl back safely!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.69,0:12:36.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.37,0:12:40.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY] Looks like skipping Arlong\NPark has sure cheered you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.58,0:12:41.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Prepare the anchor!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.82,0:12:44.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bring us alongside the {\i1}Going Merry{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.82,0:12:46.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.92,0:12:49.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP sighs] Yes!\NNow that we're under way,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.71,0:12:51.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,it's time to give a name to this voyage.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.85,0:12:55.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think I shall call it, "The\NGreat Adventures of Captain Usopp."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.14,0:13:04.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.86,0:13:07.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx80\fscy80\bord3.04\shad3.04}What is it? What'd you see?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.66,0:13:09.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BOTH] It's fishmen!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.16,0:13:11.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx80\fscy80\bord3.04\shad3.04}[USOPP] Full speed ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.83,0:13:12.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx80\fscy80\bord3.04\shad3.04}[JOHNNY] Okeydoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.47,0:13:17.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why didn't we just dock right there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.14,0:13:18.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP, JOHNNY] Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.84,0:13:19.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Didn't you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.97,0:13:22.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There were three fishmen\Nover there. It's Arlong's crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.88,0:13:25.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We can't stop here right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.18,0:13:26.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do not yell at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.98,0:13:31.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If there are fishmen here, this entire\Narea must be under Arlong's control.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.14,0:13:32.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.71,0:13:36.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Huh. We could just\Nsay we couldn't find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.02,0:13:39.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Untie me now, morons! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.46,0:13:42.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FISHMAN A] Huh.\NNever seen that boat before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.50,0:13:43.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.64,0:13:45.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP, JOHNNY gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.97,0:13:46.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's run.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.90,0:13:47.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.87,0:13:50.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Untie me! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.81,0:13:52.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY, USOPP gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.98,0:13:54.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.14,0:13:58.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] Hey, you two, get back\Nhere or you're gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.07,0:14:03.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.53,0:14:05.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's just this one guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.17,0:14:08.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Maybe he just drifted here from\Nreal far out or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.20,0:14:09.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.84,0:14:11.96,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] Those guys are dead\Nand they don't even know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.97,0:14:14.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Or maybe somebody just wanted\Nhim to die real slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.72,0:14:17.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FISHMAN A] I think we\Nshould take him to Arlong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.50,0:14:18.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.29,0:14:19.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.81,0:14:22.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I will tell Luffy that you were\Ncourageous to the bitter end.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.85,0:14:26.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me, Zoro!\NI'll never forget you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.70,0:14:28.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay, now let's find some land.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.87,0:14:30.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY] Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.86,0:14:36.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY grunts] I think\Nthis place is called Gosa Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.86,0:14:38.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.27,0:14:42.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY, USOPP gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.81,0:14:56.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Uh. What happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.22,0:15:01.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I heard Arlong came through here a few\Nweeks back but I never thought that...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.89,0:15:04.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Everything's upside down!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.86,0:15:07.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've heard people say that\Nfishmen can be stronger than
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.96,0:15:10.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,normal human beings by\Na very wide margin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.23,0:15:15.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I guess this is how strong you have\Nto be to survive the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.65,0:15:20.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.34,0:15:24.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Maybe, but even the\Nstreet's upside down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.95,0:15:28.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The monster Momoo\Ncaused this destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.11,0:15:29.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.92,0:15:33.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me this place has monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.42,0:15:37.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We caught him out on the Grand Line\Nand brought him back here with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.06,0:15:38.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] From the Grand Line, huh...?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.98,0:15:41.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait... {\i1}We{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.34,0:15:42.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[yelps]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.53,0:15:45.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You! You were with\Nthat guy from the boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.34,0:15:47.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP yelps]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.52,0:15:48.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Later!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.39,0:15:49.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FISHMAN A] Come back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.39,0:15:55.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[JOHNNY sighs] That was close.\NI wish you luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.81,0:15:59.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I'll just hold my position here and wait\Nhere for our backup from Yosaku and Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.38,0:16:02.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP laughs]\NYou may be a fishman,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.88,0:16:05.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but there is no way you can\Ncatch me on dry land.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.42,0:16:07.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP laughs]\NI'm a very fast runner!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.32,0:16:10.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm a beautiful gazelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.12,0:16:13.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP grunts]\NWhat the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.31,0:16:15.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Got you, stupid fishman!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.11,0:16:18.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And now I'll avenge my\Nfather by killing you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.42,0:16:19.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[shouts]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.63,0:16:20.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHABO groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.46,0:16:21.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[yelps]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.17,0:16:21.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[whimpers]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.90,0:16:22.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] Honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.42,0:16:27.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}How many times do I have to tell you, Chabo,\Nyou do not mess with the fishmen?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.76,0:16:30.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It was just one person who\Ndecided to stand up to them
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.02,0:16:33.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and they responded by\Nslaughtering everyone in Gosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.53,0:16:36.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] Hm. You look and\Nsmell just like a fishman,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.67,0:16:39.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but I can see that\Nyou're human. Mostly human.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.51,0:16:41.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah! Mostly?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.21,0:16:43.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FISHMAN A] Where'd you go? Over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.78,0:16:44.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.04,0:16:46.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A fishman!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.25,0:16:47.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And this time it's for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.08,0:16:52.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Alright. Stand back\Nand let me handle this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.72,0:16:56.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Watch as Captain Usopp... takes out\Nthis fishman with a single shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.00,0:16:59.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.04,0:17:02.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}It's my\NSpecial Attack: Lead Star.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.33,0:17:05.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.70,0:17:10.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I guess he wasn't listening\Nwhen I said the fishmen
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.84,0:17:12.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,would kill us if we messed with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.34,0:17:13.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come on, tough guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.50,0:17:26.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]\NWhere am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.34,0:17:27.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] My house.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.51,0:17:29.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] H... Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.34,0:17:30.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sleep well?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.35,0:17:31.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Uh. Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.88,0:17:35.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm Nojiko. I grow\Ntangerines here. Want one?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.49,0:17:38.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right! You're the\None that hit me on the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.83,0:17:42.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just when I was going to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.72,0:17:44.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] I'm the one who saved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.47,0:17:45.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.01,0:17:46.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] If you had\Nactually gone through with
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.15,0:17:50.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,attacking that fishman, you\Nwould have been killed for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.71,0:17:52.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stupid outsider.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.34,0:17:57.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You'd figure a kid from here\Nwould already know better.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.05,0:18:02.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What would make a child\Ndo something so reckless?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.11,0:18:04.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's a question I'd really\Nlike an answer for.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.18,0:18:06.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHABO] I know... I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.18,0:18:11.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But they killed my daddy.\NThey took everything from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.18,0:18:14.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those fishmen destroyed\Nour town, killed my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.80,0:18:17.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I had to make them pay for\Nwhat they did, no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.00,0:18:19.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't you get that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.67,0:18:22.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So I went to Arlong Park by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.84,0:18:25.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But this girl stopped me from going in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.54,0:18:26.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[inaudible]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.73,0:18:32.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHABO] She's like an evil witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.47,0:18:35.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't stand this!\NI have to avenge my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.45,0:18:37.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't care if I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.12,0:18:38.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.62,0:18:42.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] If you're truly\Nprepared to die, then go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.43,0:18:45.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But you had better understand,\Nboy... I stopped you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.13,0:18:48.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And this witch you hate kept you\Nfrom carrying out your revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.37,0:18:51.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So far you've cheated death twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.65,0:18:53.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[chair clatters]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.26,0:18:54.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] Just finish your tea and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.92,0:18:57.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're being a little\Nrough on 'em, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.61,0:18:59.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO exhales]\NI don't care who he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.64,0:19:02.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If he wants to kill himself,\Nthen so be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.75,0:19:06.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He doesn't have what it\Ntakes to suffer for revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.09,0:19:07.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.59,0:19:08.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] It takes time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.96,0:19:10.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I suffer, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.89,0:19:13.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Revenge is not an easy\Npath for one to carve out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.06,0:19:17.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And to die just because\Nyou're too foolish
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.50,0:19:19.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,for patience is\Nnothing but a coward's plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.73,0:19:26.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHABO] Wh... What do you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.87,0:19:29.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHABO] I can't stand\Nthe way I feel but...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.05,0:19:31.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How's your mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.22,0:19:35.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.16,0:19:40.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then go back home.\NShe's worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.26,0:19:53.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP chuckles]\NFor a chick with tattoos,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.26,0:19:54.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you're actually really sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.80,0:19:59.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[NOJIKO] Piss off... It's time you told me\Nwhy you decided to come here to our village.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.43,0:20:01.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Oh, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.14,0:20:03.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] My name is Captain Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.17,0:20:05.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for a girl named Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.14,0:20:11.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No way! She's a part\Nof the Arlong crew?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.74,0:20:13.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] It certainly looks that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.75,0:20:16.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everybody here knows that cow.\NEven the little boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.12,0:20:19.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It gets better though.\NThat cow is my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.12,0:20:21.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We grew up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.85,0:20:25.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, technically she's my adopted\Nsister, since we were both orphans.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.86,0:20:30.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But a sister's a sister,\Nyou know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.56,0:20:34.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.55,0:20:35.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.76,0:20:37.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Nami's house?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.06,0:20:40.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] It's mine too. We were\Nraised together in this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.73,0:20:45.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[NOJIKO] She's the closest thing to family\NI have left since our foster mother died.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.38,0:20:47.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO sighs] The three of us\Nused to be so happy together
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.92,0:20:49.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,in Cocoyashi Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.79,0:20:53.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP growls] So...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.53,0:20:56.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}You're telling me that Nami betrayed\Nher mother, her sister and her whole village
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.99,0:20:59.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,just to be a part of Arlong's crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.36,0:21:02.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] Yeah, pretty much.\NA real witch, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.83,0:21:06.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn. Nami is a total witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.16,0:21:08.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She had us completely\Nfooled the entire time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.83,0:21:11.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,To think she was just after\Nthe treasure for herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.78,0:21:14.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even after she risked her\Nlife to save my village.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.95,0:21:18.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.\NShe seemed so happy with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.99,0:21:21.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah? She was happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.46,0:21:23.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh... My sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.70,0:21:27.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We came here to try to convince\Nher to come back with us,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.93,0:21:30.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but I guess now that's pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.48,0:21:34.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasping]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.36,0:21:36.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I just remembered that\Na shipmate of mine
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.06,0:21:40.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,was taken prisoner by the\Nfishmen before we got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.93,0:21:43.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm in trouble. I hope he's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.97,0:21:45.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I hope he's at least not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.47,0:21:48.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FISHMAN B] Open the gates!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.26,0:21:50.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We have a prisoner on board this vessel!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.31,0:22:02.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,One more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.91,0:22:05.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What was your purpose in\Ncoming here to this island?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.91,0:22:11.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Like I said before, I'm looking\Nfor a girl, you half-fish bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.68,0:22:15.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG scoffs] Wow!\NFor someone I'd consider a good meal,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.84,0:22:19.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you are either really stupid or\Nyou've got a lot of guts in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.51,0:22:23.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We fishmen are, simply, the\Nnext rung up the evolutionary
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.14,0:22:25.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,ladder from you pathetic humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.34,0:22:26.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We are incredibly resilient.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.18,0:22:29.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We can breathe both on\Nland and underwater,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.05,0:22:32.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,an ability which\Nclearly establishes our
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.27,0:22:34.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,physical superiority over you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.97,0:22:37.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't know if this will make\Nany sense to that puny brain
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.92,0:22:41.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}rolling around in your head, but fishmen...\Nare the lords of all creatures
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.13,0:22:44.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and to fight against us\Nis to defy nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.96,0:22:48.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] I'm really sick of listening\Nto your big ideas, Arlong.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.72,0:22:50.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.77,0:22:52.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why are you always so serious, Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.90,0:22:55.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know that I wasn't\Ntalking about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.81,0:22:57.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You are a very special human,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.44,0:23:00.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,our greatest navigator and a\Nvalued member of this crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.90,0:23:02.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You always have been.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.33,0:23:07.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Say what you will, but I'm a lot smarter\Nthan any of you, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.30,0:23:09.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why did he call you\Nhis navigator, Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.44,0:23:13.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can't honestly expect me\Nto believe you work for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.44,0:23:15.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold on, is this guy\Na friend of yours, Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.61,0:23:16.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.91,0:23:20.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is just another fool who\Nthought I wasn't going to steal
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.27,0:23:22.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,all of his treasure right\Nout from under his nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.79,0:23:29.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}To think he actually followed me here\Nwithout knowing that shows how stupid he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.36,0:23:31.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So this is the person you really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.03,0:23:34.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All along I thought you\Ncouldn't stand pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.83,0:23:37.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You thought wrong. It was all an act.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.00,0:23:39.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And you bought the whole show.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.19,0:23:43.53,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.53,0:23:45.74,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.53,0:23:53.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm a pirate, plain and simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.57,0:23:56.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And a navigator... for Arlong.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.12,0:24:00.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG laughs] She had\Nyou guys completely fooled!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.03,0:24:03.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's no use. She's cold-blooded.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.00,0:24:08.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She betrayed her family for money,\Nso you really shouldn't feel too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.24,0:24:14.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}If I were you, I would just admit defeat\Nand try to forget the day you met her.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.18,0:24:16.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] I don't need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.68,0:24:21.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh. Because I never saw anything in\Nher to be trusted in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.75,0:24:25.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If she turned out to be a serial\Nkiller, I wouldn't be surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.37,0:24:27.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Fine! Then why don't you\Njust get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.37,0:24:29.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.11,0:24:30.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.12,0:24:31.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.20,0:24:33.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.03,0:24:33.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.99,0:24:34.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.95,0:24:36.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.29,0:24:40.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FISHMEN gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.70,0:24:43.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey... Anybody know why that\Nguy just jumped in the water?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.13,0:24:46.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It looks to me like he was just\Ntrying to get away from Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.67,0:24:47.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FISHMAN E] I don't blame him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.47,0:24:49.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She can be really mean sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.23,0:24:52.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[FISHMAN F] Maybe he's trying to escape,\Nany of you geniuses think of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.33,0:24:54.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FISHMAN D] With his arms\Nand legs tied up?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.23,0:24:57.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I gotta say that looked a lot\Nmore like a suicide attempt to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.00,0:24:58.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Leave him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.52,0:25:04.15,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] That idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.70,0:25:13.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FISHMEN gasp, chatter]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.20,0:25:16.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.12,0:25:16.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI, ZORO grunt]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.83,0:25:17.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FISHMAN C] They're back up!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.53,0:25:19.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FISHMAN D] She saved him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.37,0:25:24.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI pants] What do\Nyou think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.57,0:25:28.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO coughs] No,\Nwhat do {\i1}you{\i0} think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.97,0:25:30.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.55,0:25:34.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO coughs] You're really\Njust a nice girl
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.23,0:25:37.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,who can't watch one guy die.\NWhy don't you quit pretending?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.85,0:25:38.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.56,0:25:39.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO grunts] And you\Nmight want to jump in
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.65,0:25:42.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,a little quicker next time.\NI thought I was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.65,0:25:44.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI grunts]\NYou bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.56,0:25:46.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.22,0:25:48.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Try that again and\NI'll make sure you die!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.52,0:25:50.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO chuckles] Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.26,0:25:51.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] That's a lot of bandages.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.86,0:25:53.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You must have been hurt pretty bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.86,0:25:55.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] Actually, I forgot my shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.03,0:25:58.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Grabbed these to cover up so\Nyou wouldn't get distracted.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.20,0:26:02.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BOTH grunt]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.54,0:26:08.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tell me... What should\Nwe do with this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.52,0:26:09.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Lock him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.53,0:26:11.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of him\Nwhen I have the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.66,0:26:14.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Arlong! Hey, Arlong!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.53,0:26:17.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah? Well, spit it out. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.69,0:26:20.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir... This guy\Ndidn't come here alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.26,0:26:24.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}There was another long-nosed, weird-looking\Nguy with him but he got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.26,0:26:26.73,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] What the hell, Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.73,0:26:29.32,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,You left me for dead\Nand got spotted anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.54,0:26:30.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FISHMAN A] I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.47,0:26:33.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think he escaped into\NCocoyashi Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.64,0:26:35.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cocoyashi, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.61,0:26:39.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's perfect. Now I\Nhave two reasons to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.21,0:26:48.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER A] Hey, Arlong's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.55,0:26:51.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER B] He is? But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.05,0:26:53.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We just paid him this\Nmonth's tribute, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.56,0:26:57.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] It's probably about\Nmy weapons cache they found.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.66,0:27:00.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everyone go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.31,0:27:02.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[VILLAGER B gasps] Genzo...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.09,0:27:03.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER C gasps]\NThey're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.60,0:27:17.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So you're the fool who thought he\Ncould hoard weapons on my island.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.37,0:27:19.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] That's me. I'm a collector.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.97,0:27:24.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is there a new law that forbids us\Nfrom having hobbies now, as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.96,0:27:24.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.31,0:27:26.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Next, you'll be telling us\Nthat we can't read books
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.07,0:27:29.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,or play with our children anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.04,0:27:31.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, hobbies are fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.15,0:27:34.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It would be weapons\Nthat I have forbidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.51,0:27:37.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They make it difficult for me\Nand my men to keep the peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.72,0:27:39.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.05,0:27:43.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's{\i0} him?! Arlong's gigantic!\NHe's not even human.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.65,0:27:45.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nope... he's a fishman.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.82,0:27:46.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] For real?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.99,0:27:49.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] I'm responsible for\Ntwenty towns and villages,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.49,0:27:52.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,including this one, and as\Nyour leader I cannot tolerate
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.89,0:27:55.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,even a little rebelliousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.22,0:27:59.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wiping out Gosa was just a small\Nexample of what can happen
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.26,0:28:02.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,when you do not do as you are told.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.26,0:28:05.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tribute money must be\Npaid no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.73,0:28:07.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What? Tribute money?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.77,0:28:09.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's just what it sounds like.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.27,0:28:11.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Money we pay him so we can stay alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.69,0:28:13.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Adults and children...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.23,0:28:17.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}If there is even a single person who\Ncan't pay... then what happened to Gosa...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.49,0:28:20.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,will happen to everyone\Nin this village as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.06,0:28:25.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Our town, and the people in it,\Nwill be wiped from existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.40,0:28:29.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] H... He destroyed an entire\Ntown because of one person?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.27,0:28:31.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] That's how Arlong rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.17,0:28:35.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}To them we're nothing but a sub-species,\Nso killing us has always been easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.54,0:28:38.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] You pathetic humans\Nneed to stop with all this
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.34,0:28:41.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"thinking" you're up to.\NIt's your greatest weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.73,0:28:45.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm allowing you to contribute\Nto greatness here!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.80,0:28:50.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Soon fishmen will conquer the humans,\Nand your tributes will be a small part
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.47,0:28:53.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,of the beginning of the\Nglorious Arlong Empire!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.00,0:28:55.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.81,0:28:57.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Arlong Empire?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.68,0:29:02.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] They're planning on taking\Nover the entire East Blue!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.40,0:29:21.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[thudding]
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.94,0:29:26.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get outta here quick.\NArlong's gonna be back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.00,0:29:38.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[Caitlin Glass singing "Run! Run! Run!"]
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=33}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=30}============================SIGNS AND TITLE=========================
